          "author": "Disney",
          "description": "Carl Fredricksen is a retired balloon salesman in search of one last adventure. Tying thousands of balloons to his house, Carl sails off in search of the lost world of his childhood dreams. But unbeknownst to Carl, Russell, an overeager 8-year-old Wilderness Explorer is in the wrong place at the wrong time... Carl’s front porch. The world’s most unlikely duo reach new heights and make new friends in this sky-bound adventure.",
